# BORGHERTZS_CALLING_HANDS (jeuno 58): the two optional coffers' sections (status not available, main job SMN, the
# [AF]ZilartCoffer bit unset). Accepted by a GM, a level 75 SMN: TempleOfUggalepih's Treasure Coffer opens to
# EvokersDoublet (the item bypass; the result is the item): [AF]ZilartCoffer +536870912 (bit 29); ToraimaraiCanal's to
# EvokersPigaches: +1073741824 (bit 30).
lists TempleOfUggalepih/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade ToraimaraiCanal/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade
char zone=TempleOfUggalepih pos=219.7,-8.1,205.8 job=SMN lvl=75
quest Jeuno.BorghertzsCallingHands accepted
item UggalepihCofferKey
item ToraimariCofferKey
login
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer UggalepihCofferKey x1 # bit 29 unset: EvokersDoublet; [AF]ZilartCoffer 536870912
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
warp -257.5,24.0,82.0 ToraimaraiCanal
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer ToraimariCofferKey x1 # bit 30 unset: EvokersPigaches; [AF]ZilartCoffer 1610612736
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
